QUERY NAME: qryIncomeByDisease
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW tblYear.PickYear AS FinancialYear, tblProject.Project, tblProject.ProjectTitle, tblProject.Disease, IIf(IsNull([YearIncome]),0,[YearIncome]) AS SYearIncome
FROM tblYear, tblProject INNER JOIN tblProjectYear ON tblProject.Project = tblProjectYear.Project
WHERE ((tblYear.PickYear=[StartFYear]+[YearNo]-1));

